OL,3,GNEWSABlind woman urges PM to ban
OL,4,Afloating bus stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blind woman who has campaigned
OL,7,Fagainst bus stops that have cycle lanes
OL,8,Fbetween the pavement and passenger
OL,9,Fwaiting island has called on the Prime
OL,10,FMinister to ban and remove them across
OL,11,Fthe country.
OL,13,FMarilyn Lant from Exeter, Devon joined
OL,14,Fother blind, deafblind, and partially
OL,15,Fsighted people and wheelchair users
OL,16,Ffrom across the United Kingdom to
OL,17,Fprotest against further roll out at
OL,18,FWhitehall on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
