OL,3,GNEWSABlind woman urges PM to ban
OL,4,Afloating bus stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile designed to protect cyclists from
OL,7,Fmain-road traffic, critics argue the
OL,8,Fso-called floating bus-stops create a
OL,9,Fhazard for vulnerable people trying to
OL,10,Fboard or leave buses.
OL,12,FLant said she wanted the stops removed
OL,13,Fbecause there was "no way I can cross a
OL,14,Ftwo-way cycleway safely with a guide
OL,15,Fdog".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
